      "title": "After Work, We'll Have Each Other",
      "gist": "If AI takes over all necessary labor, status and meaning will come from personal relationships instead of jobs, reviving older, more constrained social worlds.",
      "question": "Work — what happens to human meaning and status once AI makes work unnecessary? (an argument from historical case studies)",
      "sourceHeading": "After Work, We'll Have Each Other"
