      "title": "Amoral familism and change",
      "gist": "Drawing on Banfield's concept of amoral familism, Gans argues that distrust of outsiders was a rational response to poverty and corrupt institutions, and that this clannishness recedes as economic conditions and opportunities improve."
    },
